      <chord name="D/A"/>Just <chord name="Em/G"/>as <chord name="D/F#"/>I <chord name="A"/>am, <chord name="D/A"/>and <chord name="Bm"/>waiting <chord name="G/D"/>not<br/>
      <chord name="A/C#"/>To rid <chord name="F#m/A"/>my soul <chord name="A7/G"/>of <chord name="G"/>one <chord name="A7/G"/>dark <chord name="D/A"/>blot,<br/>
