      <chord name="D/A"/>Just <chord name="Em/G"/>as <chord name="D/F#"/>I <chord name="A"/>am, <chord name="Bm"/>poor, <chord name="C#dim"/>wretched, <chord name="G/D"/>blind;<br/>
      <chord name="A/C#"/>Sight, riches, <chord name="F#m/A"/>healing <chord name="G"/>of <chord name="A7/G"/>the <chord name="D/A"/>mind,<br/>
