      <chord name="D/A"/>Just <chord name="Em/G"/>as <chord name="D/F#"/>I <chord name="A"/>am, <chord name="D/A"/>Thy <chord name="Bm"/>love <chord name="C#dim"/>I <chord name="G/D"/>own<br/>
      <chord name="A/C#"/>Has broken <chord name="F#m/A"/>every <chord name="G"/>barrier <chord name="D/A"/>down;<br/>
